{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify OS 2.0 liquid block called "Collection carousel with static cards". Follow every requirement below exactly.
    
    CAROUSEL WRAPPER & SHADOW:
    
    Outermost wrapper: overflow: visible, never overflow: hidden
    Scroll container: overflow-x: auto, overflow-y: visible
    Scrollbar fully hidden (scrollbar-width: none, ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none })
    Carousel track must have padding: 20px 8vw so shadows breathe on all sides and are never clipped
    No overflow: hidden anywhere in the block — not on wrapper, track, or any card
    CARD LAYOUT — 5 TOTAL:
    
    Cards use flex-shrink: 0, scroll-snap-align: center
    Scale animation: inactive cards at transform: scale(0.85), active card at transform: scale(1.0), transition 0.3s ease
    Active card is detected via JavaScript IntersectionObserver or scroll event — closest card to center gets class active
    Anti-bounce flag (isSnapping) to prevent scroll loop
    CARD SIZE SETTINGS (all editable from theme editor):
    
    Mobile:
    
    Card width: range setting, min 55, max 90, step 1, unit vw, default 72 — label "Ancho de tarjeta (móvil)"
    Card height: range setting, min 280, max 520, step 10, unit px, default 390 — label "Alto de tarjeta (móvil)"
    Image height: range setting, min 150, max 380, step 10, unit px, default 250 — label "Alto de imagen (móvil)"
    Desktop (inside @media screen and (min-width: 750px)):
    
    Card width: range setting, min 20, max 60, step 5, unit vw, default 30 — label "Ancho de tarjeta (escritorio)"
    Card height fixed at 390px on desktop
    Image height fixed at 255px on desktop
    CARD DESIGN SETTINGS:
    
    Background color picker, default #FFFFFF — label "Fondo de tarjeta"
    Card border radius: range, min 0, max 50, step 2, unit px, default 36
    Image border radius: range, min 0, max 50, step 2, unit px, default 24
    Shadow opacity: range, min 0, max 50, step 5, default 10 — use divided_by: 100.0 in Liquid to convert to CSS decimal. Example: rgba(0,0,0,{{ block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }})
    Gap between cards: range, min 10, max 50, step 2, unit px, default 20
    IMPORTANT for all range settings: verify that default is always a valid step in the range (i.e., (default - min) is divisible by step). If not, adjust default to the nearest valid value.
    
    CARDS 1–3: Dynamic collection cards Each has an independent collection picker. Displays:
    
    Collection featured image (fills image wrapper, object-fit: cover)
    Collection title as <h3> — use collection.title | default: 'Colección' with NO number appended
    Collection description — optional, show/hide checkbox toggle
    Button linking to collection.url
    CARDS 4–5: Static custom cards (visually identical to collection cards) Each card has independent settings:
    
    image_picker — custom image
    text — custom heading, default "Título" (no number)
    text — button label, default "Ver más"
    url — button link No description field on static cards. These cards must match collection cards exactly in height, image proportions, padding, and border radius.
    TYPOGRAPHY:
    
    Title (all cards):
    
    Font picker, default serif
    Size range, min 14, max 48, step 2, unit px, default 22
    Color picker, default #000000
    Description (collection cards only):
    
    Show/hide checkbox, default false
    Font picker, default sans-serif
    Size range, min 12, max 24, step 1, unit px, default 14
    Color picker, default #666666
    BUTTON (shared for all 5 cards):
    
    Shared button text for collection cards (text setting, default "Ver colección")
    Static cards use their own individual button text field
    Font picker, default sans-serif
    Size range, min 10, max 24, step 1, unit px, default 13
    Background color, default #000000
    Text color, default #FFFFFF
    Hover background, default #383838
    Hover text color, default #FFFFFF
    Border radius range, min 0, max 50, step 2, unit px, default 0
    Padding: 14px 32px
    Text uppercase, letter-spacing 1px
    Transition: all 0.3s ease
    JAVASCRIPT — SNAP & ACTIVE CARD:
    
    Use a custom element (customElements.define) with a unique name based on block.id
    On scroll, find the card closest to the center of the track and add class active
    After 150ms of scroll inactivity, snap to the nearest card using scrollBy with behavior: smooth
    Use isSnapping boolean flag to prevent scroll event loop during programmatic snap
    Release flag after 400ms timeout
    On connectedCallback, activate first card via requestAnimationFrame
    SCHEMA RULES (critical):
    
    Do NOT use collection_4 or collection_5 — those slots are replaced by static image cards
    Every range setting must have (default - min) % step === 0 — validate before outputting
    Do not use decimal values in range min, max, step, or default — use integers only
    The block must be fully compatible with Shopify OS 2.0 and render correctly in the theme editor, necesito que todos los textos puedan centrarse y que tengan una forma de hacer padding en las tarjetas para modificar su tamaño, alineacion, altura y anchura 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: visible;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    padding: 20px 8vw;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    scroll-snap-align: center;
    width: {{ block.settings.card_width_mobile }}vw;
    height: {{ block.settings.card_height_mobile }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: visible;
    transform: scale(0.85);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    transform: scale(1.0);
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height_mobile }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 200px;
    max-height: 200px;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.content_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.content_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.content_padding_bottom }}px {{ block.settings.content_padding_horizontal }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.description_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.description_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.description_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    flex-grow: 1;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.card_width_desktop }}vw;
      height: 390px;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 255px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..3) %}
        {% liquid
          assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i
          assign collection = block.settings[collection_key]
        %}
        
        <div class="ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
          <div class="ai-collection-carousel-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if collection and collection.featured_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ collection.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ collection.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="800"
                height="800"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-collection-carousel-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'collection-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          
          <div class="ai-collection-carousel-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ collection.title | default: 'Colección' }}
            </h3>
            
            {% if block.settings.show_description and collection.description != blank %}
              <div class="ai-collection-carousel-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ collection.description }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            
            <a
              href="{{ collection.url | default: '#' }}"
              class="ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}

      {% for i in (4..5) %}
        {% liquid
          assign image_key = 'static_image_' | append: i
          assign title_key = 'static_title_' | append: i
          assign button_key = 'static_button_' | append: i
          assign url_key = 'static_url_' | append: i
          
          assign static_image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign static_title = block.settings[title_key]
          assign static_button = block.settings[button_key]
          assign static_url = block.settings[url_key]
        %}
        
        <div class="ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card-index="{{ forloop.index | plus: 2 }}">
          <div class="ai-collection-carousel-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if static_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ static_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ static_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="800"
                height="800"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-collection-carousel-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'collection-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          
          <div class="ai-collection-carousel-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ static_title }}
            </h3>
            
            <a
              href="{{ static_url | default: '#' }}"
              class="ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
              {{ static_button }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CollectionCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.scrollContainer = null;
        this.track = null;
        this.cards = [];
        this.isSnapping = false;
        this.scrollTimeout = null;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.scrollContainer = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.track = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}'));
        
        this.setupEventListeners();
        
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          this.updateActiveCard();
        });
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        this.scrollContainer.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          if (!this.isSnapping) {
            this.updateActiveCard();
            this.handleScrollEnd();
          }
        });
      }

      updateActiveCard() {
        const scrollLeft = this.scrollContainer.scrollLeft;
        const containerWidth = this.scrollContainer.offsetWidth;
        const centerPosition = scrollLeft + containerWidth / 2;

        let closestCard = null;
        let closestDistance = Infinity;

        this.cards.forEach((card) => {
          const cardLeft = card.offsetLeft;
          const cardWidth = card.offsetWidth;
          const cardCenter = cardLeft + cardWidth / 2;
          const distance = Math.abs(centerPosition - cardCenter);

          if (distance < closestDistance) {
            closestDistance = distance;
            closestCard = card;
          }
        });

        this.cards.forEach((card) => {
          card.classList.remove('active');
        });

        if (closestCard) {
          closestCard.classList.add('active');
        }
      }

      handleScrollEnd() {
        clearTimeout(this.scrollTimeout);
        
        this.scrollTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
          this.snapToNearestCard();
        }, 150);
      }

      snapToNearestCard() {
        const scrollLeft = this.scrollContainer.scrollLeft;
        const containerWidth = this.scrollContainer.offsetWidth;
        const centerPosition = scrollLeft + containerWidth / 2;

        let closestCard = null;
        let closestDistance = Infinity;

        this.cards.forEach((card) => {
          const cardLeft = card.offsetLeft;
          const cardWidth = card.offsetWidth;
          const cardCenter = cardLeft + cardWidth / 2;
          const distance = Math.abs(centerPosition - cardCenter);

          if (distance < closestDistance) {
            closestDistance = distance;
            closestCard = card;
          }
        });

        if (closestCard) {
          this.isSnapping = true;
          
          const cardLeft = closestCard.offsetLeft;
          const cardWidth = closestCard.offsetWidth;
          const cardCenter = cardLeft + cardWidth / 2;
          const targetScroll = cardCenter - containerWidth / 2;
          const scrollDiff = targetScroll - scrollLeft;

          this.scrollContainer.scrollBy({
            left: scrollDiff,
            behavior: 'smooth'
          });

          setTimeout(() => {
            this.isSnapping = false;
          }, 400);
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CollectionCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

